<div data-panel="{&quot;clickOnActivate&quot;:&quot;firstChild&quot;}" role="button" class="forum_topic  unread sticky" id="forum_General_40572925_6620894968771615797"  data-gidforumtopic="6620894968771615797" data-tooltip-forum="			&lt;div class=&quot;topic_hover_text&quot;&gt;
				If you're getting stuck on the launcher, or your screen launches to a flickering or solid color screen, there is a workaround!
First, you can try to add these launch parameters before starting the game:
 
  On Steam, right-click Big Ambitions and go to &amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;.
  In the &amp;quot;General&amp;quot; tab, add this to the &amp;quot;Launch Options&amp;quot; section:
  -screen-quality Low -screen-fullscreen 0 -screen-width 1024 -screen-height 768
 
Disable &amp;quot;Game Mode&amp;quot; for the Mac, as that can sometimes cause issues.

